{"clip_id": "Eng_007018", "text_verbatim": "And now, words and their stories.", "annotation_status": "L1_DONE", "transcript_source": "manual"}
{"clip_id": "Eng_007019", "text_verbatim": "from VIA Learning English.", "annotation_status": "L1_DONE", "transcript_source": "manual"}
{"clip_id": "Eng_007020", "text_verbatim": "On this program, we explore words and expressions in the English language.", "annotation_status": "L1_DONE", "transcript_source": "manual"}
{"clip_id": "Eng_007021", "text_verbatim": "We give definitions, examples, notes on usage, and sometimes we use them in short conversations.", "annotation_status": "L1_DONE", "transcript_source": "manual"}
{"clip_id": "Eng_007022", "text_verbatim": "Today, we talk about the process of learning to do something.", "annotation_status": "L1_DONE", "transcript_source": "manual"}
{"clip_id": "Eng_007023", "text_verbatim": "If you want to play a musical instrument,", "annotation_status": "L1_DONE", "transcript_source": "manual"}
{"clip_id": "Eng_007024", "text_verbatim": "you need to learn how.", "annotation_status": "L1_DONE", "transcript_source": "manual"}
{"clip_id": "Eng_007025", "text_verbatim": "You learn how to hold or sit at the instrument.", "annotation_status": "L1_DONE", "transcript_source": "manual"}
{"clip_id": "Eng_007026", "text_verbatim": "You learn how to read notes and how to play basic chords.", "annotation_status": "L1_DONE", "transcript_source": "manual"}
{"clip_id": "Eng_007027", "text_verbatim": "Then you progress to short easy songs.", "annotation_status": "L1_DONE", "transcript_source": "manual"}
{"clip_id": "Eng_007028", "text_verbatim": "In other words, you need to take baby steps.", "annotation_status": "L1_DONE", "transcript_source": "manual"}
{"clip_id": "Eng_007029", "text_verbatim": "Babies can look funny when they are learning to walk.", "annotation_status": "L1_DONE", "transcript_source": "manual"}
{"clip_id": "Eng_007030", "text_verbatim": "their steps are unsure.", "annotation_status": "L1_DONE", "transcript_source": "manual"}
{"clip_id": "Eng_007031", "text_verbatim": "Their knees do not quite bend fully.", "annotation_status": "L1_DONE", "transcript_source": "manual"}
{"clip_id": "Eng_007032", "text_verbatim": "They do not walk straight and often fall down.", "annotation_status": "L1_DONE", "transcript_source": "manual"}
{"clip_id": "Eng_007033", "text_verbatim": "The more they walk, the steadier they get on their feet.", "annotation_status": "L1_DONE", "transcript_source": "manual"}
{"clip_id": "Eng_007034", "text_verbatim": "Soon they're on steady baby steps.", "annotation_status": "L1_DONE", "transcript_source": "manual"}
{"clip_id": "Eng_007035", "text_verbatim": "Lead to a smoother", "annotation_status": "L1_DONE", "transcript_source": "manual"}
{"clip_id": "Eng_007036", "text_verbatim": "often speedy gate.", "annotation_status": "L1_DONE", "transcript_source": "manual"}
{"clip_id": "Eng_007037", "text_verbatim": "We often use the term to describe how to reach a complex goal.", "annotation_status": "L1_DONE", "transcript_source": "manual"}
{"clip_id": "Eng_007038", "text_verbatim": "Small baby steps.", "annotation_status": "L1_DONE", "transcript_source": "manual"}
{"clip_id": "Eng_007039", "text_verbatim": "can lead to the bigger goal.", "annotation_status": "L1_DONE", "transcript_source": "manual"}
{"clip_id": "Eng_007040", "text_verbatim": "We will often use the term to suggest that someone slow down and be patient.", "annotation_status": "L1_DONE", "transcript_source": "manual"}
{"clip_id": "Eng_007041", "text_verbatim": "A similar English expression goes...", "annotation_status": "L1_DONE", "transcript_source": "manual"}
{"clip_id": "Eng_007042", "text_verbatim": "You have to walk before you can run.", "annotation_status": "L1_DONE", "transcript_source": "manual"}
{"clip_id": "Eng_007043", "text_verbatim": "Let's listen as two friends use these idioms.", "annotation_status": "L1_DONE", "transcript_source": "manual"}
{"clip_id": "Eng_007044", "text_verbatim": "Hey, how are your piano lessons going?", "annotation_status": "L1_DONE", "transcript_source": "manual"}
{"clip_id": "Eng_007045", "text_verbatim": "Slowly, I want to play a real song.", "annotation_status": "L1_DONE", "transcript_source": "manual"}
{"clip_id": "Eng_007046", "text_verbatim": "But my teacher has me working on these same set of chords over and over again.", "annotation_status": "L1_DONE", "transcript_source": "manual"}
{"clip_id": "Eng_007047", "text_verbatim": "They are difficult and boring at the same time.", "annotation_status": "L1_DONE", "transcript_source": "manual"}
{"clip_id": "Eng_007048", "text_verbatim": "I've been playing piano for years, and chords are important.", "annotation_status": "L1_DONE", "transcript_source": "manual"}
{"clip_id": "Eng_007049", "text_verbatim": "They are the foundations of music.", "annotation_status": "L1_DONE", "transcript_source": "manual"}
{"clip_id": "Eng_007050", "text_verbatim": "You need to know how to walk before you can run.", "annotation_status": "L1_DONE", "transcript_source": "manual"}
{"clip_id": "Eng_007051", "text_verbatim": "But I also must be able to play a song by next month.", "annotation_status": "L1_DONE", "transcript_source": "manual"}
{"clip_id": "Eng_007052", "text_verbatim": "Why are you in such a hurry?", "annotation_status": "L1_DONE", "transcript_source": "manual"}
{"clip_id": "Eng_007053", "text_verbatim": "Learning music requires patience. Take baby steps.", "annotation_status": "L1_DONE", "transcript_source": "manual"}
{"clip_id": "Eng_007054", "text_verbatim": "Please, no more advice.", "annotation_status": "L1_DONE", "transcript_source": "manual"}
{"clip_id": "Eng_007055", "text_verbatim": "I told a friend I could play the piano, and now she wants me to play at her children's birthday party.", "annotation_status": "L1_DONE", "transcript_source": "manual"}
{"clip_id": "Eng_007056", "text_verbatim": "Oh, in that case, I have other advice for you.", "annotation_status": "L1_DONE", "transcript_source": "manual"}
{"clip_id": "Eng_007057", "text_verbatim": "You reap what you sow.", "annotation_status": "L1_DONE", "transcript_source": "manual"}
{"clip_id": "Eng_007058", "text_verbatim": "Hey, what are you doing next month?", "annotation_status": "L1_DONE", "transcript_source": "manual"}
{"clip_id": "Eng_007059", "text_verbatim": "Learning a language is a lifelong process.", "annotation_status": "L1_DONE", "transcript_source": "manual"}
{"clip_id": "Eng_007060", "text_verbatim": "to keep yourself from burning out.", "annotation_status": "L1_DONE", "transcript_source": "manual"}
{"clip_id": "Eng_007061", "text_verbatim": "Take baby steps.", "annotation_status": "L1_DONE", "transcript_source": "manual"}
{"clip_id": "Eng_007062", "text_verbatim": "Learn a little every day.", "annotation_status": "L1_DONE", "transcript_source": "manual"}
{"clip_id": "Eng_007063", "text_verbatim": "and soon your English will be fabulous.", "annotation_status": "L1_DONE", "transcript_source": "manual"}
{"clip_id": "Eng_007064", "text_verbatim": "And that's all the time we have for this, words and their stories.", "annotation_status": "L1_DONE", "transcript_source": "manual"}
{"clip_id": "Eng_007065", "text_verbatim": "I'm Andrew Smith.", "annotation_status": "L1_DONE", "transcript_source": "manual"}
